# Arabic "between" framing -- "بين ... و ..." ("between January and March").
# Pairs with marker_and (و).
# "بين" (bayna): W. Wright, *A Grammar of the Arabic Language*, 3rd ed., vol. II,
#   §46 -- بين "between", governing two coordinated terms joined by و.
#   Badawi, Carter & Gully, *Modern Written Arabic*, §2.9 s.v. بين.
بين
